  "notes": [
    "Plan only until T3 and Codex validate prerequisites, exact API fields, tier availability and current cost.",
    "No public app traffic, Hosting rewrites, real payments, customer data migration or service-account JSON keys.",
    "App TTL/deletion is enforced by durable application cleanup; bucket lifecycle is only fallback, not exact 24h guarantee.",
    "Builder has no deployment permissions; explicit service account in Cloud Build requests.",
    "Soft delete wire field: softDeletePolicy.retentionDurationSeconds, 0 on newly created empty media bucket only.",
    "Cloud SQL creation, SQL roles and DB password secrets are superseded and forbidden. Existing unused VPC/PSA resources are preserved, not reapplied or deleted.",
    "Firestore IAM, separate worker/dispatcher identities and recovery manifests require validation before apply. No grants performed by this plan.",
    "PostgreSQL remains the local pilot/reference only; cloud persistence and outbox use Firestore, with no resident polling."
